feat(phase3): pile management — search, replen, disturb, shuffle

Add temp Phase 3 pile mechanics (dev buttons + board interactions):

- Pile search pop-up (PileSearchModal): reusable window listing deck,
  graveyard, or replen cards; clickable tiles open the inspection panel.
- Open the pop-up by clicking the graveyard/replen pile on the board, not
  just the dev buttons. Pop-up open state now lives in the store
  (pileSearch + openPileSearch/closePileSearch) so board input and dev
  buttons share it.
- Replen mechanics: send a random occupied Zone-A (+ linked Zone-C) card to
  the replenish pile; "disturb" sends the deck's top card to replen.
- Shuffle: animated riffle (deck splits into two lifted piles then collapses
  back randomized). Buttons to fold replen, graveyard, or the hand into the
  deck and reshuffle. Pure Fisher-Yates shuffleArray with injectable rng.
- selectCard broadened to any existing card so pile cards are inspectable.

Local-only; Player 2 and real turn flow still pending.

